1 NAME Adriane Jensdatter /Schielderup/
2 GIVN Adriane Jensdatter
2 SURN Schielderup
1 NAME Bispedatter Adriane Jensd Schielderup
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1554
