1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Erik Munch or Munk had an extra-maritial affair with a woman called Signe from Bryne (possibly from Helleland), Haa, from the same district where Erik war born and baptized (by his own father). 
2 CONT Signe got pregnant and then left together with Erik to Sylt (today Germany), to get rid of the unwanted child. Erik and Signe never married.
2 CONT Unclear what happened to Erik thereafter. He may have returned to Norway, but rather stayed in Denmark, as there don´t seem to be any traces in Norway from him, apart from his birth entry.
2 CONT He came back once more to Sylt in 1762, so he probably did not emigrate to America, but maybe after 1762....
2 CONT Further details of the story upon request. Would be fun to find out where life had carried him.... 
