2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1. Gurine Marie Pedersdatter 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.1. Lars Nicolai Pederssøn 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.1. Paul Johan Pederssøn 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.1. Niels Christian Pederssøn 
