1 NAME Bjørn Larsen /Jelsa/
2 GIVN Bjørn Larsen
2 SURN Jelsa
2 _MARNM Jelsa
1 NAME Bjørn Larsson /Sandanger/
2 GIVN Bjørn Larsson
2 SURN Sandanger
2 _MARNM Jelsa
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1685
2 PLAC Ytre Sandanger
2 ADDR
3 CITY Randøy
