1 NAME Asser Endresen
2 GIVN Asser Endresen
2 NICK Endresen
1 NAME Asser Endresen
2 GIVN Asser Endresen
2 SURN
2 NICK Einarsen
2 NICK Einerson
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1614
