1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bernt Christian was a Norwegian ship captain, who sailed into many harbors during his career at sea.  In Falmouth he met and married Kate King, a beautiful lady who had been orphaned at the age of 10.  He returned 
2 CONC to Norway with her and built her a beautiful home which still stands today.  She raised their three children while he sailed the seas.  He died and was buried at sea, leaving her a widow with three young children  He was very well
2 CONC  thought of by friends and co-workers.  
