1 NAME Hans Jørgen Jacobsen /Darre/
2 GIVN Hans Jørgen Jacobsen
2 _MARNM Darre
1 NAME Hans Jørgen /Darre/
2 GIVN Hans Jørgen
2 SURN Darre
1 SEX M
1 OCCU Sogneprest
