1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Antje Blaauw''' was born on February 24, 1797 in Rotterdam, Government of Rotterdam, South Holland, Netherlands. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-72348958 Jacob Jacobsz Blaauw] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-72
2 CONC 349103 Jacoba Johanna van der Putten]. She was a housewife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Antje married [https://www.geni.com/profile-86409178 Antonius Nicolaas Bouvy] on April 7, 1817 in Bergen Noorwegen. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-86409429 Petronella Catharina Bouvy]; [htt
2 CONC ps://www.geni.com/profile-86409589 Jacoba Petronella Dorothea Bouvy]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86408749 Nicolaus Marius Bouvy]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86410230 Johanna Jacoba Bouvy]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86410
2 CONC 562 Maria Anna Suzanna Henriette Bouvy]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86410683 Jacobus Johannes Bernardus Josephus Bouvy]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-86411181 Catharina Maria Anthoinette Bouvy]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-8
2 CONC 6411562 Theodor Joännes Antonius Bouvy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 27, 1888 in Dordrecht, Dordrecht, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands and was buried there. 
2 CONT ----
