2 CONC fikk avskjed 17/11-1894. Han var i mange år stortingsmann. Han ble 1877 kommandør av St. Olavs Orden. Even took matriculation in 1830 and became legally candidate 1835. 1838 he became sheriff and judge in East Finmarken, 1852 Byfo
2 CONC ged in Fredrikshald. 5 / 11-1863 he was appointed assessor by the Supreme Court, from which office he received farewell 17 / 11-1894. He was for many years a Member of Parliament. He became in 1877 commander of the Order of St. Ol
2 CONC av.
