1 NOTE {geni:about_me} An englishman named Brooke was visiting Finnmark in 1820. First he stayed at the Lennings then the Bucks, and in his book he describes Marie Elisabeth as she was on a short visit at her parents: "I was struck by th
2 CONC is young ladys face - so fair and eautiful, elegant, as made to live in a castle, not to wither among the cold rocks in Finnmark." She was 22 and married the year before. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bosted: Malene Marie1822-84 g. Bernh Martin Aagaard 1812-70 
