1 OCCU cap, 1607 Præst i Stepping-Frørup, Sognepræst i Stepping-Førup, Bishop, 
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 1607. [p. Cap.* 02, o. 13/1] Laurits (Laurentius) Foss (Voss) fra Haderslev; St. i Wittenberg 96; ~ 14/2 02 F. D. Agathe Jespersdtr. Bruun; see David F. t. Ribe Cathr. K.; [† 1640; (J. 215; R. 342; Had. Joh. 30; Witt. Matr.; V.
2 CONC  f. K. 2 R. VII. 506 L. 23–19 n.); Achelis I, nr. 917; PT 16:3 (1975), s. 40].
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wiberg-net.dk/1460-Stepping.htm
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
2 CONT Two different men are being confounded here: Laurits Andersden Foss, son of Anders Mikkelsen F. and Laurits Christensen Foss, son of Christen Nielsen F.
2 CONT
2 CONT One was born about 1575-6 and the other about 1585-7. Their wifes are similarly confused, being combinations of "Marine/Marina", "Agathe/Agatha", "Christiansdatter" and "Bruun". It is not entirely clear who was the father of which
2 CONC  children.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Lauritz FOSS died on 15 July 1640 in Steppinge,,Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Agathe BRUUN. Agathe BRUUN and Lauritz FOSS were married in 1602 in Of, Stepping, Haderslev, Denmark.4 Children were: David Lauritzen FOSS.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift 14-02-1602 i Stepping Kirke, Sønder Tyrstrup, Haderslev, Danmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Præst i Stepping-Frørup. 
