1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daniel Michelson Wulf, b. 1635, d. 1713, married in Seljord on 18 Feb 1672 Maria Zachariasdtr Schanche, b. 1655, d. 1736, dtr of Pastor Zacharias Jonson Schanche & his second wife, Sarka Jansdtr (Groll?). Daniel M.
2 CONC  Wulf was assistant pastor is Seljord when he married Maria, then took over the ministry after Pastor Schanche died.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria was married to Zacharias's chaplain and successor as pastor in Seljord, Daniel Mikkelsson/Michaelsson Wolf (1635-1713). Before they moved into the pastor's residence at Skornes in Sejord, they lived at Hougstoga (Haugstoga i
2 CONC n Flatdal. I know they had these children: Kristina, Daniel and Katarina. Sarka's father was Jan Giertsen (Groll) (ca. 1589-ca.1643). His parents were Giert Jansen "Hollender" (Groll) (1550-1628, borne in Harlem, Netherlands) and 
2 CONC Eufemia (Femia) Søfrensdtr. She may have been of Ansbach ancestry, after Jørgen von Ansbach's daughter Karen Jørgensdtr. Ansbach, who married 1. Søfren/Severin Nielsen i Skien.
1 FAMC @F6000000006847808732@
1 RFN geni:6000000006847930663
1 SUBM @S296644121930004853@
1 OBJE
